E("Slow-cooker beef goulash","700g stewing beef; 1 onion; 2 peppers; garlic; 400g chopped tomatoes; 250ml beef stock; paprika","Brown beef if desired. Add all ingredients to the cooker and cook until beef is tender. Serve with potatoes, rice or crusty bread.","https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/collection/budget-slow-cooker-recipes","7–8 hours on LOW","20 minutes"),
E("Slow-cooker butter chicken","700g chicken thighs; 1 onion; garlic; mild curry paste; 400g chopped tomatoes; 100ml stock; 100ml cream; butter","Add chicken, onion, garlic, paste, tomatoes and stock. Cook until chicken is fully cooked. Stir in cream and butter near the end and serve with rice.","https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/collection/budget-slow-cooker-recipes","5–6 hours on LOW"),
