E("Slow cooker Spanish chicken","8 chicken thighs; chorizo; 1 onion; 2 peppers; chopped tomatoes; olives; stock; smoked paprika","Fry chorizo briefly. Add all ingredients to cooker and stir. Cook until chicken is thoroughly cooked; serve with rice or crusty bread.","https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/collection/slow-cooker-recipes","6–7 hours on LOW","20 minutes"),
E("Slow-cooker roast chicken","1 whole chicken sized to fit; 1 onion; 1 lemon; garlic; thyme; black pepper","Place onion in cooker and chicken on top. Add lemon, garlic and thyme. Cook according to your appliance and chicken guidance until the thickest parts are fully cooked. Grill briefly to crisp skin if desired.","https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/collection/slow-cooker-recipes","Check appliance guidance","10 minutes"),
