E("Slow cooker chicken chasseur","8 chicken thighs; 1 onion; mushrooms; chopped tomatoes; stock; garlic; thyme","Add all ingredients to cooker and stir. Cook until chicken is fully cooked and tender. Serve with mash or rice.","https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/collection/slow-cooker-recipes","6–7 hours on LOW"),
