E("White chicken chilli","700g chicken thighs; 1 onion; garlic; cannellini beans; 500ml chicken stock; cumin; cream cheese","Cook chicken, onion, garlic, drained beans, stock and cumin until chicken is cooked through. Shred chicken, stir in cream cheese and heat until creamy.","https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/collection/slow-cooker-recipes","5–6 hours on LOW"),
