E("Slow cooker turkey curry","700g turkey thigh; onion; curry paste; chopped tomatoes; coconut milk; stock; pepper","Add turkey, onion, curry paste, tomatoes, stock and pepper. Cook until turkey is fully cooked, stir in coconut milk for the final 20 minutes and serve with rice.","https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/collection/budget-slow-cooker-recipes","5–6 hours on LOW"),
