E("Vegetable stew with cheddar dumplings","leek; carrots; potatoes; courgette; peas; vegetable stock; mustard; self-raising flour; cheddar","Cook chopped vegetables, stock and mustard until nearly tender. Mix flour and cheese with cold water to form dumplings. Add peas and dumplings, then cook on HIGH until dumplings are cooked through.","https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/collection/slow-cooker-recipes","5–6 hours on LOW","20 minutes"),
E("Slow cooker vegetable lasagne","aubergine; courgette; pepper; passata; oregano; lasagne sheets; ricotta; mozzarella","Layer vegetable passata sauce with lasagne sheets and ricotta, finishing with sauce and mozzarella. Cook on LOW until pasta is tender and the centre is piping hot; cooker timings vary.","https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/collection/budget-slow-cooker-recipes","3–4 hours on LOW","20 minutes"),
