E("Pasta e fagioli","onion; carrots; celery; garlic; chopped tomatoes; vegetable stock; cannellini beans; small pasta","Cook vegetables, tomatoes, stock, drained beans and oregano until tender. Add pasta near the end and cook until just done. Add hot water if needed and season.","https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/collection/slow-cooker-recipes","5–6 hours on LOW","15 minutes"),
