E("Three-bean slow cooker chilli","onion; pepper; garlic; kidney beans; black beans; cannellini beans; tomatoes; tomato purée; chilli powder; stock","Drain and rinse beans. Add all ingredients to cooker and stir. Cook until vegetables are tender; mash a few beans to thicken and serve with rice.","https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/collection/slow-cooker-recipes","5–6 hours on LOW","15 minutes"),
E("Slow cooker mushroom stroganoff","600g mushrooms; onion; garlic; vegetable stock; Dijon mustard; paprika; crème fraîche","Cook mushrooms, onion, garlic, stock, mustard and paprika until tender. Thicken if needed, then stir in crème fraîche at the end and serve with noodles or rice.","https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/collection/slow-cooker-recipes","3–4 hours on LOW","10 minutes"),
E("Slow cooker chickpea and spinach curry","chickpeas; onion; garlic; ginger; curry paste; tomatoes; coconut milk; spinach","Add drained chickpeas, onion, garlic, ginger, curry paste and tomatoes. Cook until flavours meld. Stir in coconut milk and spinach for the final 20 minutes; serve with rice.","https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/collection/slow-cooker-recipes","4–5 hours on LOW","15 minutes"),
